   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Join the Cape Cod Cannabis Loyalty VIP Program & Earn Rewards!"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>At <b>Cape Cod Cannabis</b> in Wellfleet, MA, we believe in rewarding our amazing customers! That’s why we offer our <b>Loyalty VIP Program</b>, designed to give back to you for shopping with us. Whether you’re stocking up on your favorite products or trying something new, every purchase earns you points that can be redeemed for <b>Accessories, Apparel, and CBD</b>!</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "How It Works"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Joining our Loyalty VIP Program is simple and <b>FREE</b>:</p><p>✅ <b>Sign up in-store</b> during your next visit.</p><p>✅ Earn points on every purchase—no hassle, no hidden fees!</p><p>✅ Redeem points for exclusive <b>Cape Cod Cannabis Accessories, Apparel and CBD products</b>.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "What Can You Redeem?"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>As a VIP member, you’ll unlock access to rewards like:</p><p><a href=\"/categories/merch/\"><b>Branded Apparel</b></a> – Rock your Cape Cod Cannabis pride with stylish hoodies, hats, and tees.</p><p><a href=\"/categories/accessories/\"><b>Accessories</b></a> – From lighters, rolling supplies, and grinders to dab tools and glassware, to enhance your cannabis experience.</p><p><a href=\"/categories/cbd/\"><b>CBD Products</b></a> – Enjoy the benefits of high-quality CBD for relaxation and wellness.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Why Join Our FREE Loyalty Program?"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><b>Save money</b> – Earn rewards just for shopping.</p><p><b>Exclusive perks</b> – Get early access to special promotions and VIP-only deals.</p><p><b>More ways to enjoy Cape Cod Cannabis</b> – Use your points on the products you love.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Visit Us & Start Earning Today!"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Don’t miss out on the perks—<b>sign up in-store </b>next time you visit us in Wellfleet. Start earning points and redeeming rewards while enjoying the best cannabis experience on Cape Cod!</p><p><b>Visit us at <a href=\"/directions/\">1446 US-6, Wellfleet, MA 02667</a></b> and ask about our VIP program today!</p>"
    }
   ]
  },
